=== 6. 8-bit / NVFP4 card-count math on 32 GiB 5090s (serving-quant standard) ===
FP8 safetensors (official repo): 212.5 GB = 197.9 GiB -> 7 cards weights-only (headroom 26.1 GiB); + 128K FP8-KV + ~7 GB runtime = 216 GiB -> 7 cards (next card up for real headroom: 8)
Q8_0 official GGUF: 209.4 GB = 195.0 GiB -> 7 cards weights-only (headroom 29.0 GiB); + 128K FP8-KV + ~7 GB runtime = 213 GiB -> 7 cards (next card up for real headroom: 8)
NVFP4 safetensors (official repo): 129.2 GB = 120.4 GiB -> 4 cards weights-only (headroom 7.6 GiB); + 128K FP8-KV + ~7 GB runtime = 138 GiB -> 5 cards (next card up for real headroom: 6)
